{% ctaSection
   heading="Program Overview"
   description="BOLD is a gap year program for graduated high school seniors, current students and recent college graduates (or age 19-24). It is aimed at equipping individuals to become more like Christ while immersing them into “real life” experiences as they better discover who they are as a young adult and pursue future career paths. Examples of ways in which participants will impact the world around them include balancing an off-site job, attending a local church, serving at camp, setting a personal budget, and reaching goals that shape them more into the image of our Creator. A primary goal of this program is to equip, guide, and build confident young men and women to serve as leaders during our Summer Camps between June and July. Through authentic Christian community, hands-on skill development, service, and adventure, participants will prepare to enter the next phase of life grounded in faith, ready to guide the future generations into a transformative way of living."
   variant="brown"
   external=false %}
Program Overview
{% /ctaSection %}

